      "ordinal": 9,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "3.2",
      "title": "Classic",
      "body": "Authenticity check is mandatory prior to the start of the tournament.\nA competitor is allowed to enter the list if they respects the following cumulative criterias.\n● Have no more than 3 minors infraction (if they have 4 or more, they will receive a green card).\n● Have no more than 1 moderate infraction (if they have 2 or more, they will receive a green card.\n● Have no major infraction.",
