      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "3.3",
      "title": "Regional",
      "body": "Authenticity check is mandatory prior to the start of the tournament.\nA competitor is allowed to enter the list if they respects the following cumulative criterias.\n● Have no more than 2 minors infraction, if you have 3 or more, then they will receive a green card.\n● Have no moderate infraction. If they have 1 or more, they will receive a green card.\n● Have no major infraction.",
