      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "3.4",
      "title": "Conference",
      "body": "Authenticity check is mandatory prior to the start of the tournament.\nA competitor is allowed to enter the list if they respects the following cumulative criterias.\n● Have no more than 1 minor infraction, if you have 2 or more, then they will receive a green card.\n● Have no moderate infraction.\n● Have no major infraction.\n\nNote: as an exceptional measure, for season 2025, tournaments of Conference level will be considered as Regional regarding Authenticity rules. It means a competitor with 1 moderate infraction will be allowed to fight, but will receive a green card.",
