      "kind": "note",
      "number": "4",
      "title": "Change log",
      "body": "Below, we will keep track of all the changes made over the lifetime of this document. This way, all our members can see how the documents are changing over time.\n\nFebruary - 2025:\n- Replaced: 1. (After vote) introducing the green card rule\n- Replaced: 2. Members | Officers || Fighters | Competitors\n- Add: 2. Any violation of the Authenticity rules will result in an infraction\n- Replaced: 3. violation breach of | greenYellow card remains the sanction for Aany” with “A violation of\n- Rephrased: 3. (After vote) to clarify the green card rule.\n- Add: 3.3 If they have 1 or more, they will receive a green card.\n- Add: 3.4: Note\n\nDecember 2024:\n-add Document has been created",
